## Assumptions & contingencies

- E2E runs against `vite dev` (scripts default to `BASE_URL http://localhost:5173/`); if the runner instead targets `vite preview`, hooks are still available via `?e2e` per Step 4 — append `?e2e` to `BASE_URL`, no code change.
- If `vitest run` shows `PlayerHand` prop-type friction from `ReadonlySet`, keep the prop `Set<number>` and type `EMPTY_SET` as `Set<number>` instead — same memo win, less churn.
- If the single-timer AI change ever delays the thinking indicator observably, restore the 0ms flag timer; the 650ms compute path stays as planned.
